{
  "feature": "Admin 43-B · Approve one waiting submitted price",
  "note": "Boards: design_handoff_bplus_redesign/addendum-6/boards/43-approve-one/approve-menu-d, approve-sheet-m, approve-m, approve-done-d, approve-failed-d. CONTACT_SHEET_ROLE=admin. The list, counts and approve calls are answered by route fixtures (the board's shows), so no price is published on the shared scratch branch. approve-busy-d (the spinner mid-request) is covered by SubmittedTab.test.tsx: a fixture answers at once. The menu, done and failed rows press the desktop menu, and the sheet row is phone-only, so each times out at the other widths by design (the phone's done and failed toasts are the same ToastDock, pinned by tests). By hand on staging: a real approve, and a 409 refusal.",
